Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:21.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宇宙海盗哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.41,0:01:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,航向770.3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就要进入拉普鲁星的引力圈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，你要怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你照预定去拉普鲁星吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.89,0:01:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有很久没见吉古鲁老爹了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.75,0:01:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从海龟号完成后，有15年没见了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个顽固老头不知怎样了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.77,0:02:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他虽然是宇宙第一的技师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.81,0:02:05.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却到处寻找金矿
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:09.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在意的只有吉古鲁先生？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.33,0:02:14.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的孙女优子 今年应该是二十岁了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定了吧，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:21.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二十二话 地底之客
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方变得真多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:46.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊！越来越危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.65,0:02:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,矿山都被挖空了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:51.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人们渐渐搬离
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:54.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城镇开始萧条下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加上现在那帮人来了以后越发萧条了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.01,0:03:06.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么！这么窄还要我让路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.95,0:03:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大叔！你在这地方飞车当心坠入崖底
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.77,0:03:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.59,0:03:14.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正在被基尔顿的机械艇追赶着！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:15.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.73,0:03:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好惨！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:55.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个人，别让他逃了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.01,0:03:56.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.07,0:03:58.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上解决
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.33,0:04:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直开火
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.21,0:04:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是打中了该怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:04:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生紧急情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:02.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机械艇一艘在397坐标点被击毁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:04.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请马上支援
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:09.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人只有一人 可是拥有火力很强的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.77,0:05:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在由7点转往9座标点方向逃窜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.71,0:05:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经在雷达上发现他了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,立即派遣4艘前往第9座标点支援
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:23.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在会合前请待机
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.33,0:05:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爹看到我一定会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乱七八糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.69,0:06:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爹！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.29,0:06:18.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉古鲁老爹！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.77,0:06:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是哈里嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.01,0:06:35.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:37.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我啊，哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:39.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥-普-拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.57,0:06:40.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.73,0:06:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骗人！长相不同！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.73,0:06:45.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说来话长 我被基尔顿追杀所以只好改头换面啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.09,0:06:48.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你仔细看看
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.57,0:06:51.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是老样子，疑心病很重啊，哈里！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…整容技术第103型式的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.25,0:07:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.07,0:07:08.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在相信我了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:15.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂，哈里，怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.45,0:07:16.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.21,0:07:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,录影带？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.49,0:07:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是一年前录的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.01,0:07:33.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于来了，哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:34.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爹
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.89,0:07:37.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看录影带的人八成是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.65,0:07:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会来这不毛之地找我的人也只有你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.49,0:07:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我快死了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是被他们弄成这个样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.53,0:07:50.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想保护矿山拼命战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.81,0:07:52.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是人已年老…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.93,0:07:54.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不甘心
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果更年轻一点的话\N就会像你一样 绝不会输给他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两年前…基尔顿来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:09.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把矿山的人接二连三地都赶出去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.61,0:08:16.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可能在山里进行什么见不得人的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，我要拜托你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿不只抢了我的矿山
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.21,0:08:25.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还把我的孙女优子掳走
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.89,0:08:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.21,0:08:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,基尔顿的基地就在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.65,0:08:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我造了台钻地机，可以帮你到那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来是寻找矿脉的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,论性能比基尔顿的机型优秀很多
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，其它的哈里会告诉你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你了，哥普拉请把优子从基尔顿的手中解救出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.25,0:09:02.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老爹
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.27,0:09:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请去救优子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.29,0:09:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈里带我到钻地机那里去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.37,0:09:22.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉了他了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.25,0:10:33.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那男人看来已经死了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:42.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:43.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么搞的？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.41,0:10:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快追！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在砂中无法行动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在那里玩砂到天黑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:28.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关闭钻石机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伸出辅助轮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.61,0:11:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.59,0:11:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那里！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.37,0:11:58.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钻地机就在那里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.01,0:12:09.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.03,0:12:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哈里快点把门打开吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.97,0:12:32.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是群烦人的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.03,0:12:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就无法轻易进来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.49,0:12:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是吉古鲁老爹制造的钻地机啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:59.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来这次的试机应该会很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.78,0:13:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.65,0:13:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那道门似乎是拉格合金制造的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:15.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收回辅助轮，开始用钻石机突击！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.38,0:13:27.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来是客人们在门外等得不耐烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.98,0:13:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！你知道怎么操纵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.34,0:13:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包在我身上！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.90,0:13:38.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会操纵的只有没装引擎的船
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.14,0:13:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！去，再加把劲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.58,0:13:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好，准备完成
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.34,0:14:01.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:08.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好！冲进去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.94,0:14:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请求紧急支援
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请求紧急支援！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.58,0:14:30.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人得到强力的钻地机！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前向东南方123度方向逃亡中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.90,0:14:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附近所有机械艇马上追击
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,5台啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.26,0:14:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左舷70度确认敌人位置
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.34,0:14:59.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分成两队开始攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.58,0:15:18.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连游乐园的娃娃靶子都打不中
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:19.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.18,0:15:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,注意前面！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.78,0:15:34.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敌人的射距比我们更长！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再接近些攻击！遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！屁股被撵上了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经到了他的后面了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.30,0:15:52.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了解了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.02,0:15:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从左舷绕到他的前面去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.58,0:16:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶！前面也出现了两艘啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.22,0:16:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他从正面冲了过来，而且速度很快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋，把他干掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.86,0:16:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,距离 2000
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.70,0:16:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1500
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,1000
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:21.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,800
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:22.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,600
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.10,0:16:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,500！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.82,0:16:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,22号机请回答！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,23号机到底发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.22,0:16:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你活着
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.18,0:16:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你必须替我带路到基尔顿的基地去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.26,0:16:49.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉 船壳温度上升
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是钻的速度太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快看啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.28,0:17:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还真惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.94,0:17:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个洞到底连接哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:29.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人到底是怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:32.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要靠过来！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.82,0:17:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优子！优子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.02,0:17:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？哥普拉来救你了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.18,0:17:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优子，你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.30,0:17:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优子，你…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，这个洞穴很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.90,0:18:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,优子，你…你还正常？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:17.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.52,0:18:20.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丢下我一个人真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.34,0:18:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是，优子，这里到底在做些什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.54,0:18:32.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是基尔顿的地下毒品加工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.14,0:18:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挖采洛顿矿石经过提炼后
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:39.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可做出比海洛英药性强20倍的毒品
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被他们绑架城镇的人\N都被强制注射了毒品来强迫他们劳动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.26,0:18:51.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不继续注射的话\N他们就会像刚才那些人一样，精神失常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.10,0:18:55.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好毒的手段 真是太过分了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我装作吃过药后精神失常
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.44,0:19:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后混入了外面的人群才逃过一劫
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.14,0:19:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地下工厂的中心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:08.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.38,0:19:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们把洛顿矿石送到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再在这个塔内进行精炼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个庞大的工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,排气口应该是通往地面的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.34,0:19:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们是能从哪里逃走了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.18,0:19:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之先跑到那个塔再说了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.74,0:19:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现入侵者！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:28.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们正在向中心塔移动！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.38,0:19:30.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快阻止他们！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.74,0:19:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们被包围了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.58,0:19:56.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧我！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是发电室
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,利用这里的地热能源来发电
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.26,0:20:18.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.90,0:20:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要制造大型的烟火出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.14,0:20:34.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大事不妙了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发电室的能量异常升高！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.46,0:20:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.74,0:20:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赶快启动紧急停止装置！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.06,0:20:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法启动！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要快点离开这里，这里就要爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.06,0:20:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所员搭乘机械艇脱离！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思，我要借用一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了，要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那艘到底是想干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然倒退进入排气口！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.78,0:21:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，我们掉下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:27.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们掉下去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.86,0:21:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们掉下去了，哥普拉！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上升了！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为能源炉爆炸了，有很多熔岩喷出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.18,0:21:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要靠熔岩送我们到地面
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:02.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太漂亮了！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.10,0:22:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用来埋藏恶人…似乎太豪华了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.44,0:22:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.26,0:22:10.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样爷爷就瞑目了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.78,0:22:16.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能和优子在熔岩上约会 真是太浪漫了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.16,0:22:17.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥普拉，你真是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂，哥普拉！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.44,0:22:20.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要碰她！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么？这混蛋！可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.02,0:22:27.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机器人还会吃醋！怎么回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.57,0:22:46.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,偶尔的去休闲一下就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.67,0:22:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且陪我的是像多明尼克这样的美女
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.44,0:22:52.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚想好不容易能享受一下就要受罪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.48,0:22:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就马上出大事件
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.61,0:22:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然想炸掉有5000人的客船
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还令我掉进海里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.85,0:23:02.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还被人下了毒药而失去知觉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.19,0:23:05.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一集\N海底的墓标
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.89,0:23:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再见面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
